+// Byte-level seek shim for the outer stream, see struct bluray_priv_s.
+//
+// Repositioning inside a Blu-ray is done with bd_seek_time() only; the byte
+// address space of the outer stream is a side effect of demuxing and cannot be
+// used to reach a different part of the disc. mpv still issues byte seeks on it
